OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to demolish former golf
OL,4,Aclubhouse withdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA plan to demolish a former golf
OL,7,Fclubhouse as part of a project to build
OL,8,F1,500 homes on the wider site has been
OL,9,Fwithdrawn after public opposition.
OL,11,FMaidenhead Golf Club moved from the
OL,12,FBerkshire town's Shoppenhangers Road
OL,13,Fcourse to the former Mill Ride Golf
OL,14,FClub in Ascot in January after it
OL,15,Fbought the latter for #11m.
OL,17,FJust over 1,300 people signed a
OL,18,Fpetition calling for the clubhouse to
OL,19,Fbe saved for the town, while groups
OL,20,Fincluding the Maidenhead Community
OL,21,FCentre expressed an interest in using
OL,22,Fthe building.
OL,23,APub: 28-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
