OL,3,GNEWSAPlan to demolish former golf
OL,4,Aclubhouse withdrawn
OL,5,
OL,6,FA demolition firm had applied to
OL,7,Fdemolish the clubhouse on the Royal
OL,8,FBorough of Windsor and Maidenhead
OL,9,Fcouncil's behalf, but the application
OL,10,Fwas formally withdrawn on Thursday.
